LAMMPS (23 Jun 2022 - Update 1)
# ==============================================================================
# Passo 3.2a: Equilibracao termica do bicristal Cu Sigma5(310) a 300 K (20 ps)
# Escala exata pelo parametro de rede bulk a(300 K) / a(0 K) = 1.00468696
# ==============================================================================
units           metal
dimension       3
boundary        p p s
atom_style      atomic

read_data       ../02_lammps_gb_310/data.gb310_H40_eq
Reading data file ...
  orthogonal box = (0 0 -40.02089) to (11.431397 14.4597 39.765702)
  1 by 1 by 1 MPI processor grid
  reading atoms ...
  1120 atoms
  reading velocities ...
  1120 velocities
  read_data CPU = 0.008 seconds

# Aplicar expansao termica de equilibrio 0 K -> 300 K antes de termostatizar
variable        s300 equal 3.631868/3.614925
change_box      all x scale ${s300} y scale ${s300} z scale ${s300} remap
change_box      all x scale 1.00468695754407 y scale ${s300} z scale ${s300} remap
change_box      all x scale 1.00468695754407 y scale 1.00468695754407 z scale ${s300} remap
change_box      all x scale 1.00468695754407 y scale 1.00468695754407 z scale 1.00468695754407 remap
Changing box ...
  orthogonal box = (-0.026789235 0 -40.025845) to (11.458186 14.4597 39.770656)
  orthogonal box = (-0.026789235 -0.033886 -40.033824) to (11.458186 14.493586 39.778636)
  orthogonal box = (-0.026789235 -0.033886 -40.228882) to (11.458186 14.493586 39.973693)

pair_style      eam/alloy
pair_coeff      * * ../00_potentials/Cu_mishin1.eam.alloy Cu Cu
Reading eam/alloy potential file ../00_potentials/Cu_mishin1.eam.alloy with DATE: 2007-10-12

neighbor        2.0 bin
neigh_modify    every 1 delay 0 check yes

reset_timestep  0
timestep        0.001

velocity        all create 600.0 741852 mom yes rot yes dist gaussian
fix             1 all nvt temp 300.0 300.0 0.1

variable        t_ps  equal step*dt
variable        T     equal temp
variable        PE    equal pe
variable        Pxx   equal pxx/1.0e4
variable        Pyy   equal pyy/1.0e4
fix             logeq all print 100 "${t_ps} ${T} ${PE} ${Pxx} ${Pyy}" file eq_gb310_300K.dat screen no title "# t_ps Temp_K PE_eV Pxx_GPa Pyy_GPa"

thermo          2000
thermo_style    custom step temp pe etotal lx ly pxx pyy
run             20000
Neighbor list info ...
